sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as FinOps Operator / API
    participant Analyzer as Cloud Cost Analyzer
    participant Detector as Anomaly Detector
    participant Reporter as Cost Reporter

    Client->>Analyzer: Submit ResourceCostItem[] Payload
    Analyzer->>Detector: Evaluate Baseline Cost Deviation
    Detector-->>Analyzer: Return AnomalyReport
    Analyzer->>Reporter: Generate Executive Summary
    Reporter-->>Client: Markdown / JSON Summary Report
